WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.420
This is the carpet at the Washington Hilton. Watch what happens to the pattern around the

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:12.180
suspect's feet. This is footage the FBI and the U.S. Attorney for D.C. released on April 30th.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.160
The alleged White House correspondent's dinner shooter walking the halls of the Washington

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:23.160
Hilton the day before the attack. The carpet has a sharp geometric pattern. You can see it clearly

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:28.960
in front of him, but behind him the pattern blurs out and turns smudgy, like the carpet isn't really

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:35.340
there. I'm not claiming this video as AI generated. I can't prove that. But carpet doesn't blur out

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:41.280
around a person who walks across it. Regular video compression smears moving objects evenly

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:47.760
across the frame. It doesn't pick one zone to smudge. What you're seeing is what happens when

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:53.140
a subject has been processed separately from the background. That's a known signature of AI

00:00:53.140 --> 00:01:00.260
manipulation. The FBI and the U.S. attorney for D.C. released this. Not one media outlet has

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:06.300
published anything questioning the authenticity of this footage. Not even the New York Times

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:13.260
visual investigations team, whose entire job, in their own words, is forensic analysis of visual

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:19.780
evidence. They published their breakdown of this exact footage on May 2nd and didn't address any

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:24.780
of the anomalies. There's no requirement that AI use in federal imagery be labeled,

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:30.340
and this administration has a documented history of pushing digitally altered images.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:37.180
The public is being told to trust this video, except there's no way for any of us to verify

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:43.560
what we're actually looking at. I'm not telling you what this is. I'm telling you what I see,

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:49.560
and what I see deserves an answer. If you think this is worth examining, share it.

00:01:49.780 --> 00:02:19.760
Thank you.
